# HW8 Reproducible Run Instructions

Run these commands from the `data260-4544/` project root.

## Install dependencies

```bash
python -m pip install -r code/requirements-hw08.txt
```

## Start Part 1 services

```bash
docker compose -f docker-compose.hw08.yml up -d --build
docker compose -f docker-compose.hw08.yml ps
```

## Run the Part 1 demonstration
```bash
python code/homework_demo.py
```

## Create Part 2 topics
```bash
bash code/hw08_kafka_pipeline/create_topics.sh
```

## Run the Part 2 agents
Open four terminals. In each terminal, change to
`code/hw08_kafka_pipeline/` and run:

```bash
python -u planner.py
python -u writer.py
python -u reviewer.py
python -u send_question.py
```

Start Planner, Writer, and Reviewer first. Run the sender after all three show
their listening messages.

## Run the Part 3 tests
Run the Writer before each test when required:

```bash
python -u replay_duplicate.py
python -u consumer_death_test.py
python -u poison_message_test.py
ORDERING_KEYED=0 python -u ordering_test.py
ORDERING_KEYED=1 python -u ordering_test.py
```

## Run the HW8 verification script

```bash
make verify-hw08
```

The verification script writes `reports/hw08/verification.json`.
